\section*{4. Shock Compression Physics}
Laser-driven shock waves generate pressures consistent with
Rankine--Hugoniot relations:
\[
P - P_0 = \rho_0 U_s U_p,
\]
where $U_s$ is shock velocity and $U_p$ is particle velocity.
Nanodiamond nucleation is observed when carbon-rich hydrocarbons
undergo demixing at $P \sim 1.5~\text{Mbar}$, validating the
UUAS mantle-layer predictions.

\section*{5. Superionic Ice Validation}
Diamond-Anvil Cell (DAC) experiments confirm the formation of
superionic H$_2$O under Uranian interior conditions. Proton
mobility within an oxygen lattice is consistent with:
\[
\sigma_{\text{ionic}} \propto n_p \mu_p,
\]
where $n_p$ is proton density and $\mu_p$ is mobility. The
validated phase supports the UUAS thin-shell dynamo model.

